{"book":"hono","chapter":"middleware-builtin","chapterTitle":"الوسائط المدمجة","slug":"pretty-json","title":"البرمجية الوسيطة Pretty JSON","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام","text":"الاستخدام"},{"depth":2,"id":"الخيارات","text":"الخيارات"},{"depth":3,"id":"space-number","text":"space: number"},{"depth":3,"id":"query-string","text":"query: string"},{"depth":3,"id":"force-boolean","text":"force: boolean"}],"html":"<p>يتيح وسيط Pretty JSON ميزة &quot;<em>طباعة JSON المنسقة</em>&quot; (JSON pretty print) لنص استجابة JSON.\nإضافة <code>?pretty</code> إلى وسيط استعلام url، تُنسَّق سلاسل JSON بشكل جميل.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GET /</span>\n{<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;project&quot;</span>:{<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;name&quot;</span>:<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Hono&quot;</span>,<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;repository&quot;</span>:<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;https://github.com/honojs/hono&quot;</span>}}\n</code></pre>\n<p>سيكون:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GET /?pretty</span>\n{\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;project&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;name&quot;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Hono&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;repository&quot;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;https://github.com/honojs/hono&quot;</span>\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { prettyJSON } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/pretty-json&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام\">الاستخدام</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">prettyJSON</span>()) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// With options: prettyJSON({ space: 4 })</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hono!&#x27;</span> })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الخيارات\">الخيارات</h2>\n<h3 id=\"space-number\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> space: <code>number</code></h3>\n<p>عدد المسافات للإزاحة. الافتراضي هو <code>2</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"query-string\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> query: <code>string</code></h3>\n<p>اسم سلسلة الاستعلام (query string) للتطبيق. الافتراضي هو <code>pretty</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"force-boolean\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> force: <code>boolean</code></h3>\n<p>عند الضبط على <code>true</code>، يتم دائمًا تنسيق استجابات JSON بغض النظر عن معامل الاستعلام. القيمة الافتراضية هي <code>false</code>.</p>\n"}